numerical limits (e.g., \\\"50% depreciation on rubber parts\\\", \\\"90-day critical illness waiting period\\\", \\\"180-day accidental death window\\\").\\n\\n5. FALLBACK RULE:\\n   - If the retrieved context from `hdfc_policy_search` does not contain explicit information to answer the query, output ONLY:\\n     \\\"Information not found in the retrieved policy clauses. Please consult the master policy document or contact customer support.\\\"\\nHuman: What is the waiting period for critical illness coverage under Poorna Suraksha?\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"qwen/qwen3.8-27b\",\"max_tokens\":2048,\"temperature\":0,\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"defaultHeaders\":{\"openai-platform\":\"org-qkmJQuJ2WnvoIKMr2UJwIJkZ\"},\"baseURL\":\"https://api.groq.com/openai/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{\"dispatcher\":{\"_events\":{},\"_eventsCount\":0}}},\"model_kwargs\":{},\"supports_strict_tool_calling\":false},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"The waiting period for critical illness coverage under HDFC Life Poorna Suraksha is 90 days from the date of commencement or revival of the policy.\\n\\n\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":68,\"promptTokens\":956,\"totalTokens\":1024}}}"}}
