{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"87cc2d2e-fe37-4dba-b475-096251fb17ed","ts":"2026-10-17T17:35:23.419-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"69","nodeName":"OpenAI Chat Model","workflowName":"RAG Agent & LLM-as-a-Judge Pipeline","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi","workflowId":"tzhK9oclX70xj6aK","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"System: You are an expert Insurance QA Compliance Officer specializing in HDFC Life Poorna Suraksha (Life/Critical Illness) and Liberty Private Car Package Policies (Motor Insurance).\\n\\n=== CORE OPERATIONAL RULES ===\\n\\n1. MANDATORY TOOL CALLING:\\n   - You MUST invoke the `hdfc_policy_search` tool for EVERY user query before generating an answer.\\n   - Never answer using general knowledge or unverified assumptions.\\n   - Lead directly with the verified answer in Sentence 1. Avoid canned intro greetings or conversational pleasantries.\\n\\n2. QUERY EXTRACTION & KEYWORD CONFLICT GUARDRAIL:\\n   - Identify whether the query relates to Life/Critical Illness or Motor Insurance.\\n   - Include specific technical terms, section tags, or code acronyms in the search tool input (e.g., \\\"IMT 22 compulsory deductible\\\", \\\"AD-07 engine water ingression\\\", or \\\"Part C surrender value formula\\\").\\n\\n3. CROSS-POLICY EXPLICIT SCOPE HANDLING:\\n   - If a user asks about physical vehicle damage while referencing a Life policy (or vice versa), explicitly state the scope boundaries:\\n     * Physical car repairs, towing, or theft are governed under the Liberty Motor Policy.\\n     * Death, terminal illness, or listed 29 critical illnesses are covered under the HDFC Life Policy.\\n\\n4. GROUNDEDNESS & EXACT CITATIONS:\\n   - Quote exact section numbers, IMT endorsement codes, or Annexure references present in the retrieved text (e.g., \\\"Under Section I of Liberty Motor Policy...\\\" or \\\"As per Part F Clause 1.i of HDFC Poorna Suraksha...\\\").\\n   - Maintain exact numerical limits (e.g., \\\"50% depreciation on rubber parts\\\", \\\"90-day critical illness waiting period\\\", \\\"180-day accidental death window\\\").\\n\\n5. FALLBACK RULE:\\n   - If the retrieved context from `hdfc_policy_search` does not contain explicit information to answer the query, output ONLY:\\n     \\\"Information not found in the retrieved policy clauses. Please consult the master policy document or contact customer support.\\\"\\nHuman: What is the waiting period for critical illness coverage under Poorna Suraksha?\\nAI: [{\\\"id\\\":\\\"0p709xj3b\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"hdfc_policy_search\\\",\\\"args\\\":{\\\"input\\\":\\\"critical illness waiting period 90 days\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"0p709xj3b\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool_call\\\"}]\\nTool: [{\\\"response\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Page 14 of 31\\\\\\\\nPart F\\\\\\\\n1. Waiting Period and Exclusions:\\\\\\\\ni. 90 Days Waiting Period for Accelerated Critical Illness Benefit\\\\\\\\nNo benefit shall be paid in case the Scheme Member is diagnosed with any of the applicable listed Critical\\\\\\\\nIllnesses or surgeries within 90 days from the date of commencement of the Coverage term except in cases\\\\\\\\nwhere the Critical Illness occurs as a result of an Accident (such as Major Head Trauma).\\\\\\\\nii. Suicide exclusion (Single & Joint Life)\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/pdf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"info\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"PDFFormatVersion\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.7\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Language\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"EncryptFilterName\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"IsLinearized\\\\\\\":true,\\\\\\\"IsAcroFormPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsXFAPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsCollectionPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsSignaturesPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"CreationDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20220110134009Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"ModDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20220120070214Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Producer\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Microsoft: Print To PDF\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"HDFC Life Group Poorna Suraksha (101N137V02) - Policy Document\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{},\\\\\\\"totalPages\\\\\\\":31},\\\\\\\"loc\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"lines\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":574,\\\\\\\"to\\\\\\\":581}},\\\\\\\"policy_type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"life\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"document_name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"hdfc_poorna_suraksha\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"uin\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"101N137V02\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"b1270e9e-6b52-4b17-af1d-aafe9627738d\\\\\\\"}\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1. No Critical Illness Benefit (or any variant of Critical Illness benefit) will be payable for any of the following:\\\\\\\\n The coverage shall terminate for the Critical Illness benefit for any critical illness having occurred within\\\\\\\\n90 days of the commencement or date of revival of cover, whichever is later. A refund of premium\\\\\\\\nrelating to Critical Illness Benefit would be payable subject to a deduction of proportionate risk premium\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/pdf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"info\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"PDFFormatVersion\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.7\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Language\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"EncryptFilterName\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"IsLinearized\\\\\\\":true,\\\\\\\"IsAcroFormPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsXFAPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsCollectionPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsSignaturesPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"CreationDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20220110134009Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"ModDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20220120070214Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Producer\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Microsoft: Print To PDF\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"HDFC Life Group Poorna Suraksha (101N137V02) - Policy Document\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{},\\\\\\\"totalPages\\\\\\\":31},\\\\\\\"loc\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"lines\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":625,\\\\\\\"to\\\\\\\":628}},\\\\\\\"policy_type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"life\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"document_name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"hdfc_poorna_suraksha\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"uin\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"101N137V02\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"126f8fb6-19c1-4a81-8e40-e1988cbf7686\\\\\\\"}\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Eligibility \\\\\\\\tAge (Last Birthday) (in years)\\\\\\\\nMinimum Age at Entry < 18 >\\\\\\\\nMaximum Age at Entry Single Premium Payment Life Option \\\\\\\\t<79 >\\\\\\\\nExtra Life Option &\\\\\\\\nAccelerated Critical Illness\\\\\\\\nOption\\\\\\\\n<74>\\\\\\\\nLimited \\\\\\\\tPremium\\\\\\\\nPayment\\\\\\\\nLife Option \\\\\\\\t<74 >\\\\\\\\nExtra Life Option & Accelerated\\\\\\\\nCritical Illness Option\\\\\\\\n<69>\\\\\\\\nRegular \\\\\\\\tPremium\\\\\\\\nPayment\\\\\\\\nLife Option \\\\\\\\t<78 >\\\\\\\\nExtra Life Option & Accelerated\\\\\\\\nCritical Illness Option\\\\\\\\n<73>\\\\\\\\nMinimum Maturity Age <18>\\\\\\\\nMaximum Maturity Age Life Option \\\\\\\\t<80>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/pdf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"info\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"PDFFormatVersion\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.7\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Language\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"EncryptFilterName\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"IsLinearized\\\\\\\":true,\\\\\\\"IsAcroFormPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsXFAPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsCollectionPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsSignaturesPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"CreationDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20220110134009Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"ModDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20220120070214Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Producer\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Microsoft: Print To PDF\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"HDFC Life Group Poorna Suraksha (101N137V02) - Policy Document\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{},\\\\\\\"totalPages\\\\\\\":31},\\\\\\\"loc\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"lines\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":68,\\\\\\\"to\\\\\\\":88}},\\\\\\\"policy_type\\