ate_car\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"uin\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"IRDAN150RP0035V02201213\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"de6d1f13-1f83-48ca-9051-245fe5ccf336\\\\\\\"}\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"during any one period of insurance in respect of any such person.\\\\\\\\n2) no compensation shall be payable in respect of death or injury directly or\\\\\\\\nindirectly wholly or in part arising or resulting from or traceable to (a) intentional\\\\\\\\nself injury suicide or attempted suicide physical defect or infirmity or (b) an\\\\\\\\naccident happening whilst such person is under the influence of intoxicating\\\\\\\\nliquor or drugs.\\\\\\\\n3) such compensation shall be payable only with the approval of the insured\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/pdf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"info\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"PDFFormatVersion\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.7\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Language\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"EncryptFilterName\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"IsLinearized\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsAcroFormPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsXFAPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsCollectionPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsSignaturesPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"CreationDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20240716141702+05'30'\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"ModDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20240716141702+05'30'\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Producer\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Corel PDF Engine Version 24.2.0.436\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Author\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Wewake\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Creator\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"CorelDRAW 2022\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"POLICY WORDINGS PRIVATE CAR PACKAGE POLICY_New.cdr\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"totalPages\\\\\\\":18},\\\\\\\"loc\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"lines\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":678,\\\\\\\"to\\\\\\\":684}},\\\\\\\"policy_type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"motor\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"document_name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"liberty_private_car\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"uin\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"IRDAN150RP0035V02201213\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"61edd904-ed40-45f0-9708-0ca731901f0e\\\\\\\"}\\\"}]}]\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"qwen/qwen3.8-27b\",\"max_tokens\":2048,\"temperature\":0,\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"defaultHeaders\":{\"openai-platform\":\"org-qkmJQuJ2WnvoIKMr2UJwIJkZ\"},\"baseURL\":\"https://api.groq.com/openai/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{\"dispatcher\":{\"_events\":{},\"_eventsCount\":0}}},\"model_kwargs\":{},\"supports_strict_tool_calling\":false},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"The waiting period for critical illness coverage under HDFC Life Poorna Suraksha is **90 days** from the date of commencement of the coverage term (or the date of revival of cover, whichever is later).\\n\\n**Key details (as per Part F, Clause 1.i of the policy):**\\n- No Accelerated Critical Illness Benefit is payable if the Scheme Member is diagnosed with any of the listed Critical Illnesses or undergoes related surgery within **90 days** of the coverage start date.\\n- **Exception:** The waiting period does not apply if the Critical Illness occurs as a result of an **Accident** (e.g., Major Head Trauma).\\n- If a critical illness occurs within this 90-day window, the Critical Illness benefit coverage terminates, and a refund of the premium relating to the Critical Illness Benefit is payable, subject to a deduction of the proportionate risk premium.\\n\\n**Citation:** HDFC Life Group Poorna Suraksha (UIN 101N137V02), Part F – Waiting Period and Exclusions, Clause 1.i (Page 14 of 31).\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":243,\"promptTokens\":2987,\"totalTokens\":3230}}}"}}
