t codes, or Annexure references present in the retrieved text (e.g., \\\"Under Section I of Liberty Motor Policy...\\\" or \\\"As per Part F Clause 1.i of HDFC Poorna Suraksha...\\\").\\n   - Maintain exact numerical limits (e.g., \\\"50% depreciation on rubber parts\\\", \\\"90-day critical illness waiting period\\\", \\\"180-day accidental death window\\\").\\n\\n5. FALLBACK RULE:\\n   - If the retrieved context from `hdfc_policy_search` does not contain explicit information to answer the query, output ONLY:\\n     \\\"Information not found in the retrieved policy clauses. Please consult the master policy document or contact customer support.\\\"\\nHuman: =What's the deductible percentage?\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"qwen/qwen3.8-27b\",\"max_tokens\":2048,\"temperature\":0,\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"defaultHeaders\":{\"openai-platform\":\"org-qkmJQuJ2WnvoIKMr2UJwIJkZ\"},\"baseURL\":\"https://api.groq.com/openai/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{\"dispatcher\":{\"_events\":{},\"_eventsCount\":0}}},\"model_kwargs\":{},\"supports_strict_tool_calling\":false},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"I need a bit more detail to give you the exact deductible percentage, as it varies by policy and cover type. Could you please clarify:\\n\\n1. **Which policy** are you asking about?\\n   - HDFC Life Poorna Suraksha (Life/Critical Illness), or\\n   - Liberty Private Car Package Policy (Motor Insurance)?\\n\\n2. **Which specific cover or component**? For example:\\n   - Motor: Own Damage, Third-Party, IMT Endorsement (e.g., IMT 22 compulsory deductible), or a specific add-on?\\n   - Life: Critical Illness, death benefit, or any rider?\\n\\nOnce you confirm, I’ll pull the exact clause and percentage from the policy documents.\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":154,\"promptTokens\":1044,\"totalTokens\":1198}}}"}}
