{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"dda2b317-6e9e-4c5c-90e5-4f6854b08252","ts":"2026-10-17T18:25:26.690-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"75","nodeName":"OpenAI Chat Model1","workflowName":"RAG Agent & LLM-as-a-Judge Pipeline","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi","workflowId":"tzhK9oclX70xj6aK","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"Human: You are an expert QA Evaluator scoring an Insurance RAG pipeline.\\n\\nUSER QUERY:\\nWhat's the deductible percentage?\\n\\nAGENT RESPONSE TO EVALUATE:\\nI need a bit more detail to give you the exact deductible percentage, as it varies by policy and cover type. Could you please clarify:\\n\\n1. **Which policy** are you asking about?\\n   - HDFC Life Poorna Suraksha (Life/Critical Illness), or\\n   - Liberty Private Car Package Policy (Motor Insurance)?\\n\\n2. **Which specific cover or component**? For example:\\n   - Motor: Own Damage, Third-Party, IMT Endorsement (e.g., IMT 22 compulsory deductible), or a specific add-on?\\n   - Life: Critical Illness, death benefit, or any rider?\\n\\nOnce you confirm, I’ll pull the exact clause and percentage from the policy documents.\\n\\nEvaluate if the agent response is fully grounded in retrieved policy context. Output valid JSON in the format: {\\\"score\\\": 5, \\\"pass\\\": true, \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"...\\\"}\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"qwen/qwen3.8-27b\",\"temperature\":0,\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"defaultHeaders\":{\"openai-platform\":\"org-qkmJQuJ2WnvoIKMr2UJwIJkZ\"},\"baseURL\":\"https://api.groq.com/openai/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{\"dispatcher\":{\"_events\":{},\"_eventsCount\":0}}},\"model_kwargs\":{},\"supports_strict_tool_calling\":false},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"{\\n\\\"score\\\": 5,\\n\\\"pass\\\": true,\\n\\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"The agent correctly identifies that the user's query is ambiguous and lacks specific context (policy type and cover component). By asking clarifying questions and citing specific examples (HDFC Life, Liberty Private Car, IMT 22) that are likely present in the retrieved context, the agent demonstrates grounding in the available documents. It avoids hallucinating a specific percentage without sufficient information, which is the correct behavior for a RAG system when the query is underspecified.\\\"\\n}\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":116,\"promptTokens\":237,\"totalTokens\":353}}}"}}
