ic technical query (3 to 6 keywords) for the vector database.\\n- Use explicit policy terminology, clause references, or codes (e.g., \\\"IMT 22 compulsory deductible\\\", \\\"AD-17 charger protection\\\", \\\"Poorna Suraksha waiting period\\\").\\n- Do NOT output explanations or conversational text.\\n- Output ONLY the refined raw search query string.\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"qwen/qwen3.8-27b\",\"max_tokens\":150,\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"defaultHeaders\":{\"openai-platform\":\"org-qkmJQuJ2WnvoIKMr2UJwIJkZ\"},\"baseURL\":\"https://api.groq.com/openai/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{\"dispatcher\":{\"_events\":{},\"_eventsCount\":0}}},\"model_kwargs\":{},\"supports_strict_tool_calling\":false,\"use_responses_api\":true},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"out-of-scope weather query intent mismatch\"}]]},\"tokenUsageEstimate\":{\"completionTokens\":8,\"promptTokens\":393,\"totalTokens\":401}}}"}}
