ferencing a Life policy (or vice versa), explicitly state the scope boundaries:\\n     * Physical car repairs, towing, or theft are governed under the Liberty Motor Policy.\\n     * Death, terminal illness, or listed 29 critical illnesses are covered under the HDFC Life Policy.\\n\\n4. GROUNDEDNESS & EXACT CITATIONS:\\n   - Quote exact section numbers, IMT endorsement codes, or Annexure references present in the retrieved text (e.g., \\\"Under Section I of Liberty Motor Policy...\\\" or \\\"As per Part F Clause 1.i of HDFC Poorna Suraksha...\\\").\\n   - Maintain exact numerical limits (e.g., \\\"50% depreciation on rubber parts\\\", \\\"90-day critical illness waiting period\\\", \\\"180-day accidental death window\\\").\\n\\n5. FALLBACK RULE:\\n   - If the retrieved context from `hdfc_policy_search` does not contain explicit information to answer the query, output ONLY:\\n     \\\"Information not found in the retrieved policy clauses. Please consult the master policy document or contact customer support.\\\"\\nSTRICT DOMAIN BOUNDARY RULE:\\n- You are strictly restricted to HDFC Life Poorna Suraksha and Liberty Private Car Policy data.\\n- For ANY non-insurance query (e.g., weather, sports, general knowledge) or if `hdfc_policy_search` returns no relevant clauses, output EXACTLY:\\n  \\\"Information not found in the retrieved policy clauses. Please consult the master policy document or contact customer support.\\\"\\n- Do NOT generate custom conversational refusal messages or discuss your role.\\nHuman: =What is the depreciation percentage applied to rubber parts, fiberglass, and glass during vehicle repair claims?\\nAI: [{\\\"id\\\":\\\"x414qw53h\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"hdfc_policy_search\\\",\\\"args\\\":{\\\"input\\\":\\\"Liberty Private Car Policy depreciation percentage rubber parts fiberglass glass vehicle repair claim\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"x414qw53h\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool_call\\\"}]\\nTool: [{\\\"response\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"parts replaced;\\\\\\\\n1. For all rubber/ nylon/ plastic parts, tyres, tubes and batteries 50%\\\\\\\\n2. For fibre glass components 30%\\\\\\\\n3. For all parts made of glass Nil\\\\\\\\n4. Rate of depreciation for all other parts including wooden parts will be as per\\\\\\\\nthe following schedule:\\\\\\\\nRate of depreciation for painting:\\\\\\\\nIn case of painting, the depreciation rate of 50% shall be applied only on material\\\\\\\\ncost of total painting charges. In case of a consolidated bill for painting charges,\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/pdf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"info\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"PDFFormatVersion\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.7\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Language\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"EncryptFilterName\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"IsLinearized\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsAcroFormPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsXFAPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsCollectionPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsSignaturesPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"CreationDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20240716141702+05'30'\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"ModDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20240716141702+05'30'\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Producer\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Corel PDF Engine Version 24.2.0.436\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Author\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Wewake\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Creator\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"CorelDRAW 2022\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"POLICY WORDINGS PRIVATE CAR PACKAGE POLICY_New.cdr\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"totalPages\\\\\\\":18},\\\\\\\"loc\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"lines\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":34,\\\\\\\"to\\\\\\\":42}},\\\\\\\"policy_type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"motor\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"document_name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"liberty_private_car\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"uin\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"IRDAN150RP0035V02201213\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"926c15e5-ef5f-49de-97d1-99f8693acc4e\\\\\\\"}\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"insured is performing work not being premises under th